/ActualText (Full-stack developer with 2+ years of experience building scalable web applications across front-end, back-end, and UI/UX \024 proficient in Next.js, React, Laravel, Node.js, and Tailwind CSS, with additional exposure to .NET, Kotlin, and Android development. Proven track record delivering production-ready systems including multi-role platforms, intelligent tutoring systems with Bayesian Network algorithms, e-commerce, and ERP-integrated tools across the healthcare and pharmaceutical industries. Comfortable working independently or in distributed teams following Agile/Scrum workflows, with strong skills in Figma-based UI/UX design, RESTful API integration, and database management \(MySQL, MongoDB, PostgreSQL\). Committed to clean code, fast iteration, and continuous growth in every project.)
